###########################################################################------ AXI4-Lite ⇆ APB bridge ------##################################################################################

AXI4-LITE SIGNALS

--- A. WRITE ADDRESS CHANNEL (AW)
AWADDR	Master → Bridge	32	Write address
AWPROT	Master → Bridge	3	Protection flags
AWVALID	Master → Bridge	1	Indicates valid AWADDR
AWREADY	Bridge → Master	1	Bridge ready


--- B. WRITE DATA CHANNEL (W)
WDATA	Master → Bridge	32	Write data
WSTRB	Master → Bridge	4	Byte-enable strobes
WVALID	Master → Bridge	1	Valid write data
WREADY	Bridge → Master	1	Bridge ready


--- C. WRITE RESPONSE CHANNEL (B)
BRESP	Bridge → Master	2	Response: OKAY, SLVERR
BVALID	Bridge → Master	1	Response valid
BREADY	Master → Bridge	1	Response taken


--- D. READ ADDRESS CHANNEL (AR)
ARADDR	Master → Bridge	32
ARPROT	Master → Bridge	3
ARVALID	Master → Bridge	1
ARREADY	Bridge → Master	1


--- E. READ DATA CHANNEL (R)
RDATA	Bridge → Master	32
RRESP	Bridge → Master	2
RVALID	Bridge → Master	1
RREADY	Master → Bridge	1


APB SIGNALS

PADDR	Bridge →  SLAVE	32	
PWRITE	Bridge →  SLAVE	 1	
PSELx	Bridge →  SLAVE	 1	
PENABLE	Bridge →  SLAVE	 1	
PWDATA	Bridge →  SLAVE	 32	


PRDATA SLAVE →  Bridge	32	
PREADY	SLAVE →  Bridge 1	
PSLVERR	SLAVE →  Bridge 1	






